    is this place?\u201D\\r\",\"parentUIDs\":[],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Mackenzie
    Joyce\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":143.5,\"yPos\":311.000183},\"ID\":7,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Mackenzie
    shivers a little. She finds that she is left with more questions. She feels as
    though she should be scared, but of what?\",\"parentUIDs\":[6,12,13],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Mackenzie
