    to figure out how she ended up here.\",\"parentUIDs\":[5],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Mackenzie
